<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Thoughts — Hannes Nagel</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Occasional writing by Hannes Nagel on building apps, tools, and other things on my mind.">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/main.css">
    <style>
        .post-list {
            display: grid;
            gap: 0.9rem;
            width: 100%;
            margin-top: 0.4rem;
        }

        .post {
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
            padding: 1.2rem 1.3rem;
            background: var(--surface-strong);
            display: grid;
            gap: 0.45rem;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: inherit;
            transition: transform 0.22s var(--ease-out), box-shadow 0.22s var(--ease-out), border-color 0.22s var(--ease-out);
        }

        .post:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
            border-color: #b3a890;
        }

        .post h3 {
            font-family: var(--serif);
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 2.6vw, 1.8rem);
            color: var(--ink);
        }

        .post p {
            color: var(--muted);
            max-width: none;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .post .read-more {
            color: var(--accent);
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .post:hover .read-more::after {
            transform: translateX(4px);
        }

        .post .read-more::after {
            content: " →";
            display: inline-block;
            transition: transform 0.22s var(--ease-out);
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div id="site-nav"></div>

    <main class="page">
        <section class="hero">
            <p class="sub-header">Thoughts</p>
            <h1>Things on my <em>mind</em>.</h1>
            <p class="lead">Occasional writing about building apps, the tools I use, and ideas I cannot let go of. No schedule, no fluff.</p>
        </section>

        <section style="align-items: flex-start;">
            <div class="post-list">
                <a class="post" href="/thoughts/blue-red-button-problem">
                    <h3>The Blue-Red Button Problem</h3>
                    <p>Why pressing blue is not just sentimental trust, but the mathematically sane choice once the group gets large.</p>
                    <span class="read-more">Read</span>
                </a>
                <a class="post" href="/thoughts/containeye-codex-update">
                    <h3>How Codex Rebuilt the ContainEye Terminal (and Why I Let It)</h3>
                    <p>A behind-the-scenes story of replacing SwiftTerm with xterm.js and shipping agentic workflows for snippets, tasks, docs reading, and approval-gated server commands.</p>
                    <span class="read-more">Read</span>
                </a>
                <a class="post" href="/thoughts/when-do-we-call-something-sentient">
                    <h3>When Do We Call Something Sentient?</h3>
                    <p>A short argument for why dismissing AI sentience with "just a machine" does not hold up.</p>
                    <span class="read-more">Read</span>
                </a>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <script src="/js/components.js"></script>
</body>

</html>
